'''Sharp-Toothed Death Fish''' is the only stage in '''Affliction in the Forest III''', which appears after clearing [[Downpour Jungle Area 16]]. It drops no items, but unlocks stages 17-20 of [[Hidden Forest of Gapra]] when cleared. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

